                      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-500 shrink-0"></span>
                      <span>Unknown</span>
                    </span>
                  )}
                </td>
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 border-t border-white/[0.06] bg-zinc-950 text-[11px] text-zinc-400">
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          We thoroughly test every patch against specific app releases so they
